OL,3,GNEWSARefused college plans allowed at
OL,4,Aappeal
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a college campus on a
OL,7,Fbusiness park have been allowed after a
OL,8,Fplanning inspector overturned a council
OL,9,Fdecision.
OL,11,FSunderland City Council previously
OL,12,Frejected the proposals for turning a
OL,13,Fvacant building at Doxford
OL,14,FInternational Business Park into a
OL,15,Fspecialist education campus over
OL,16,Fconcerns it would take away land
OL,17,Freserved for employment.
OL,19,FBut the Planning Inspectorate gave UK
OL,20,FManagement College (UKMC) the green
OL,21,Flight to transform the building
OL,22,Ffollowing an appeal.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,399,390,260,160,0,100
