OL,3,GNEWSARefused college plans allowed at
OL,4,Aappeal
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe inspector said demand for
OL,7,Femployment space was "not as strong as
OL,8,Fsuggested" in the council's local plan
OL,9,Fand the development would boost skills
OL,10,Fand create jobs.
